 ```
 
+Footnotes are numbered, and listed at the end of the document, in the order in
+which they are first referenced in the text, regardless of the order of their
+definitions. References within footnote definitions are ordered after those in
+the body. Footnotes which are defined but never referenced are listed last, in
+definition order. Set the `USE_DEFINITION_ORDER` option to `True` to order
+footnotes by definition instead.
